From: Tobias <ruck.tobias@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 7 Mar 2021 13:44:17 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Rename fRequireStandard to fRequireStandardPolicy (and
 associated method) (#40)

Rebase provenance: this historical change was adapted onto the pinned
Bitcoin ABC base. Source diff is the recorded Lotus V1 replay commit below.

Historical-source-commit: 5f933ffbc4bfa519db5ca39ea3abe01e495d0418
Recorded-replay-commit: f38d6d7e4a875bd15e3d6420befd22862c6b5ee1

